<title>USA: Sawtek names Monetti president.</title>
<headline>Sawtek names Monetti president.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sawtek Inc on Friday said Gary Monetti was promoted to president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Monetti was previously vice president of operations and chief operating officer, the company said.</p>
<p>Steven Miller, formerly president, chairman and chief executive officer of the company, will retain his titles as chairman and CEO.</p>
<p>Sawtek makes electronic signal-processing components based on surface acoustic wave (SAW) technology.</p>
</text>
